格式示例（仅结构，不是来源事实）：evidence:[{"paragraph_id":"p3s1","fact":"该片段支持的中文转述"}]。请从本次真实输入挑选编号。","role":"system"},{"content":"{"metadata":{"description":"Live2D companion for DeepSeek Harness: render a Cubism model in the Web UI with state-driven expressions and mouse tracking. · DSH 桌宠的 Live2D 渲染插件","id":"gh:1336152323","install_available":true,"language":"JavaScript","name":"dsh-live2d-pet","slug":"ankesu/dsh-live2d-pet","topics":["deepseek-harness","desktop-pet","dsh","dsh-plugin","live2d","pet"]},"paragraphs":[{"id":"p1s1","text":"Live2D companion for DeepSeek Harness: render a Cubism model in the Web UI with state-driven express"},{"id":"p1s2","text":"ions and mouse tracking. · DSH 桌宠的 Live2D 渲染插件"},{"id":"p2s1","text":"# dsh-live2d-pet"},{"id":"p3s1","text":"> A Live2D companion pet for DeepSeek Harness — renders a Cubism model as a floating companion in th"},{"id":"p3s2","text":"e Web UI, with state-driven expressions, mouse tracking, drag repositioning, and a header toggle but"},{"id":"p3s3","text":"ton.\n>\n> DSH 桌宠 Live2D 插件：在 Web UI 里渲染一个 Cubism 模型作为浮动桌宠，支持状态联动表情、鼠标跟随、拖拽摆位、顶栏一键开关。"},{"id":"p4s1","text":"### 🐱 Haru/ 人型（默认分支）"},{"id":"p5s1","text":"The bundled official **Haru** sample model (Live2D Inc.):"},{"id":"p6s1","text":"附带官方 Haru 示例模型（© Live2D Inc.）："},{"id":"p7s1","text":"### 🐱 Tororo Cat pets / 白猫宠物（分支）"},{"id":"p8s1","text":"The official **Tororo & Hijiki** cat sample models\n(Live2D Inc.) run as\npets on the `feat/tororo`\nbr"},{"id":"p8s2","text":"anch — cats with ear/tail/paw parameters, parameter-snapshot expressions\n(no exp3 files needed), and"},{"id":"p8s3","text":" the sample's `Idle`/`Tap` motions:"},{"id":"p9s1","text":"官方 **Tororo & Hijiki** 猫示例模型（© Live2D Inc.）在\n`feat/tororo`\n分支上作为宠物运行——猫有耳朵/尾巴/爪子参数、参数快照表情（无需 exp3 文件"},{"id":"p9s2","text":"）、\n以及自带 Idle/Tap 动作："},{"id":"p10s1","text":"### 🐱 Hijiki Cat pets / 黑猫宠物（分支）"},{"id":"p11s1","text":"> Switch to a branch for cat pets: / 切到分支即可用猫宠物：\n> - White cat **Tororo**: `git checkout feat/tororo"},{"id":"p11s2","text":"` → `pnpm build` → configure `model: tororo/tororo.model3.json`\n> - Black cat **Hijiki**: `git check"},{"id":"p11s3","text":"out feat/hijiki` → `pnpm build` → configure `model: hijiki/hijiki.model3.json`\n> (both branches use "},{"id":"p11s4","text":"the same parameter-snapshot client; only the model path differs)"},{"id":"p12s1","text":"## Table of Contents / 目录"},{"id":"p13s1","text":"- Features / 功能\n- Cat pets (branch) / 猫宠物（分支）\n- Install / 安装\n- Enable / 启用（必读）\n- Configuration / 配置\n"},{"id":"p13s2","text":"- State → Expression map / 状态表情映射\n- Debug handles / 调试句柄\n- Bring your own model / 换自己的模型\n- Architect"},{"id":"p13s3","text":"ure & pitfalls / 架构与排雷\n- Development / 开发\n- License / 许可"},{"id":"p14s1","text":"## Features / 功能"},{"id":"p15s1","text":"| | English | 中文 |"},{"id":"p16s1","text":"| 🐳 **Real Live2D** | Powered by pixi-live2d-display (Cubism 4), rendered on a transparent floating "},{"id":"p16s2","text":"canvas | 基于 pixi-live2d-display（Cubism 4）渲染，透明浮动画布 |\n| 👀 **Mouse tracking** | Head turns and gaze fo"},{"id":"p16s3","text":"llow your cursor (`ParamAngleX/Y`, `ParamEyeBallX/Y`); the iris is written every frame so expression"},{"id":"p16s4","text":" snapshots can't clobber it | 头部与视线跟随鼠标；瞳孔每帧写入，表情快照覆盖不了 |\n| 😊 **State-driven expressions** | The mod"},{"id":"p16s5","text":"el's `.exp3.json` expressions map to harness activity states (`idle/waiting/thinking/tool/done/faile"},{"id":"p16s6","text":"d/sleep/…`) plus hover & drag | 表情按 AI 活动状态切换（idle/waiting/thinking/tool/done/failed/sleep…）+ hover/"},{"id":"p16s7","text":"拖拽反馈 |\n| 🎬 **Idle motion + fidgets** | The model's idle motion runs constantly; random tap motions p"},{"id":"p16s8","text":"lay as idle micro-antics | 常驻待机动作；空闲时随机播小动作（发呆/挠头） |\n| 🎛️ **Config-driven geometry** | Size / positi"},{"id":"p16s9","text":"on / offsets come from `cordis.patch.yml` — tweak without rebuilding | 大小/位置/偏移全在 `cordis.patch.yml`"},{"id":"p16s10","text":" 配置，改配置不用重编译 |\n| 🖱️ **Drag repositioning** | Drag the pet anywhere; the offset persists in `localSto"},{"id":"p16s11","text":"rage` (with a viewport sanity-clamp against off-screen bugs) | 可拖拽到任意位置，偏移持久化（带防怼出屏幕的钳制） |\n| 💾 **Tog"},{"id":"p16s12","text":"gle button & persistence** | A ✨ header button (next to the dsh-emoji-wallet 💰 button) shows/hides t"},{"id":"p16s13","text":"he pet instantly; state survives refreshes & restarts | 顶栏 ✨ 按钮（dsh-emoji-wallet 钱包 💰 旁边）一键开关，状态跨刷新/"},{"id":"p16s14","text":"重启保留 |\n| 🔗 **Session state linkage** | Watches the DSH conversation session — deep thinking / sleep "},{"id":"p16s15","text":"/ celebrate are time-driven | 监听 DSH 会话——深思考 / 睡觉 / 庆祝等按时间驱动 |"},{"id":"p17s1","text":"The ✨ toggle button lives in the session header, right next to the 💰 wallet\nbutton from dsh-emoji-wa"},{"id":"p17s2","text":"llet\n(an optional companion plugin — the pet works fine without it; the wallet just\nhappens to sit i"},{"id":"p17s3","text":"n the same utilities row):"},{"id":"p18s1","text":"顶栏 ✨ 开关按钮（会话头部，dsh-emoji-wallet\n[该节后续省略]"},{"id":"p19s1","text":"## Install / 安装"},{"id":"p20s1","text":"All install methods below were verified end-to-end in a clean profile (2026-08-28):\nharu from the np"},{"id":"p20s2","text":"m registry, and each cat branch from GitHub — `pnpm install`\nruns a `prepare` script that builds `li"},{"id":"p20s3","text":"b/client.js` automatically, and the\nbundled `cordis.patch.yml` already points at the right model. Ze"},{"id":"p20s4","text":"omatically, and the\nbundled `cordis.patch.yml` already points at the right model. Zero extra config."},{"id":"p21s1","text":"以下安装方式均已在干净 profile 中完整实测（2026-08-28）：haru 走 npm registry，\n黑白猫走 GitHub 分支——`pnpm install` 会自动执行 `pre"},{"id":"p21s2","text":"pare` 构建 `lib/client.js`，\n包内 `cordis.patch.yml` 已默认指向对应模型，零额外配置。"},{"id":"p22s1","text":"### Notes for git-branch installs / Git 分支安装注意事项"},{"id":"p23s1","text":"1. **Proxy** — GitHub fetches can stall without one. If installs hang, configure\nyour proxy (e.g. `n"},{"id":"p23s2","text":"pm config set proxy http://127.0.0.1:7897` / `https-proxy`),\nor set `HTTP_PROXY`/`HTTPS_PROXY` env v"},{"id":"p23s3","text":"ars for the install command.\nGit 拉取 GitHub 可能卡住。卡住时配代理（如 `npm config set proxy http://127.0.0.1:7897"},{"id":"p23s4","text":"`\n与 `https-proxy`），或在安装命令前设 `HTTP_PROXY`/`HTTPS_PROXY` 环境变量。\n2. **pnpm allowBuilds** — pnpm blocks t"},{"id":"p23s5","text":"he `prepare` build script by default\n(supply-chain protection). If you see `ERR_PNPM_GIT_DEP_PREPARE"},{"id":"p23s6","text":"_NOT_ALLOWED`,\nadd the exact line it prints to `pnpm-workspace.yaml` under `allowBuilds:`.\npnpm 默认拦截"},{"id":"p23s7","text":" `prepare` 构建脚本（供应链保护）。若报\n`ERR_PNPM_GIT_DEP_PREPARE_NOT_ALLOWED`，把报错打印的那一行加到\n`pnpm-workspace.yaml` 的"},{"id":"p23s8","text":" `allowBuilds:` 下即可。\n3. **Enable the pet** — after install, the pet does not show until enabled:\ncli"},{"id":"p23s9","text":"ck the ✨ header button or run `localStorage.setItem('dsh-live2d-pet','1')`\nin the browser console, t"},{"id":"p23s10","text":"hen reload.\n装完后宠物不会自动显示——点顶栏 ✨ 按钮或在浏览器 Console 执行\n`localStorage.setItem('dsh-live2d-pet','1')`，然后刷新页"},{"id":"p23s11","text":"n reload.\n装完后宠物不会自动显示——点顶栏 ✨ 按钮或在浏览器 Console 执行\n`localStorage.setItem('dsh-live2d-pet','1')`，然后刷新页面。"},{"id":"p24s1","text":"Use a different profile by changing `--profile <name>` (e.g. `test`)."},{"id":"p25s1","text":"> 换成自己的 profile 只需改 `--profile <name>`（例如测试端 `test`）。"},{"id":"p26s1","text":"## Architecture & pitfalls / 架构与排雷"},{"id":"p27s1","text":"### How it works / 工作原理"},{"id":"p28s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"}],"truncated":true}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
